  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Place gnocchi in a baking dish. Drizzle with olive oil (2 tbs for 2 people / 1/4 cup for 4 people). Season, toss to coat and spread out evenly.\n• Bake until golden, 15-18 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/633fc781741acc3c5c0fe495/step-5e82b318.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop semi-dried tomatoes.\n• Roughly tear kale leaves, then discard stems.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/633fc781741acc3c5c0fe495/step-ab00d07d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat.\n• Cook soffritto mix, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic paste and garlic & herb seasoning and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add passata, the water, the brown sugar and vegetable stock powder. Simmer until thickened slightly, 1-2 minutes. Add semi-dried tomatoes, kale and red pesto and cook, stirring, until kale is wilted, 1-2 minutes. Remove from heat. Stir through the butter and gnocchi.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/633fc781741acc3c5c0fe495/step-bbf9b900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Season the tomato and red pesto gnocchi to taste, then divide between bowls. Crumble over fetta cubes.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/633fc781741acc3c5c0fe495/step-2c03a4f2.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
